  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"代理商-财务管理\",\"巨量营销-资金、钱包与结算\"],\"business_line\":[\"代理商\",\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"支持查询减款方与加款方之间最大可转金额、减款方非品牌最大可转出金额、加款方非品牌最小转入金额。为保证转账申请成功率，在发起转账申请前，需做相关校验。配合接口有【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"cg_transfer.wallet_transfer.can_transfer_balance\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/cg_transfer/wallet/transfer/can_transfer_balance/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1799667820221452\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求该接口需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1799667820221452\",\"title\":\"资金共享-最大可转余额查询\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XJcO7mm7\">支持查询减款方与加款方之间最大可转金额、减款方非品牌最大可转出金额、加款方非品牌最小转入金额，</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-HPDV75b9\">为了最大限度保证转账申请成功率，在发起转账申请之前，建议调用方做以下校验：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-JG8ci1B2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0blIFLjI\">减款钱包<strong>非品牌资金</strong>申请转账金额 &lt;= 减款钱包<strong>非品牌资金</strong>最大可转出金额（non_brand_max_transfer_balance）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Wcn8P0Be\">减款钱包<strong>资金-业务线维度</strong>申请转账金额  &lt;= 减款钱包<strong>资金-业务线维度</strong>可转金额（remitter_capital_detail_list）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JiIC4BD5\">加款钱包<strong>非品牌资金</strong>申请转账金额 &gt;= 加款钱包<strong>非品牌资金</strong>最小转入金额（non_brand_min_transfer_balance）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-W3dQWnbO\">加款钱包<strong>资金-业务线维度</strong>申请转账金额 &lt;= 加款钱包<strong>资金-业务线维度</strong>可转金额（payee_transfer_amount_detail_list.capital_detail_list）</li></ul>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201798748064957456%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-j15TdEcB\" id=\"h346b9f0-j15TdEcB\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-0ITZb2UR\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/cg_transfer/wallet/transfer/can_transfer_balance/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/cg_transfer/wallet/transfer/can_transfer_balance/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1799667820221452\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-A90fa5L9\" id=\"h346b9f0-A90fa5L9\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-Lehjg6no\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-BQa4c3Po\" id=\"h346b9f0-BQa4c3Po\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WjuAHnIY\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-bKAeJfXf\" id=\"h346b9f0-bKAeJfXf\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QfgYqT33\">鉴权账户</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lQCvbX4j\">鉴权账户类型 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ABjRNgCe\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cD0HO6hE\"><code>AD</code> 巨量客户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jEWNWdCb\"><code>AGENT</code> 代理</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XFD4UdWY\"><code>LOCAL</code> 本地推客户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">biz_request_no</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-09hovOjY\">请求id，推荐uuid，方便请求链路对齐</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">main_wallet_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gsWhGjWM\">大钱包id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">sub_wallet_list</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kZHCu8QY\">小钱包id列表</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">transfer_direction</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-n3IOTzJT\">转账方向，以小钱包视角确定 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-NKLEn5JY\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-epe4MoDM\"><code>TRANSFER_IN</code> 转入</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8Z15hB0C\"><code>TRANSFER_OUT</code> 转出</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Lh5SDGdZ\" id=\"h346b9f0-Lh5SDGdZ\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Fcg_transfer%2Fwallet%2Ftransfer%2Fcan_transfer_balance%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_id%20%3D%20ACCOUNT_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_type%20%3D%20ACCOUNT_TYPE%5Cn%20%20%20%20biz_request_no%20%3D%20BIZ_REQUEST_NO%5Cn%20%20%20%20main_wallet_id%20%3D%20MAIN_WALLET_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20sub_wallet_list_list%20%3D%20SUB_WALLET_LIST%5Cn%20%20%20%20sub_wallet_list%20%3D%20json.dumps(sub_wallet_list_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20transfer_direction%20%3D%20TRANSFER_DIRECTION%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20my_args%20%3D%20%5C%22%7B%5C%5C%5C%22account_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22account_type%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22biz_request_no%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22main_wallet_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22sub_wallet_list%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%25s%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22transfer_direction%5C%5C%5